{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/extras/2d7a48a64d15f6a3503676f884ef3382.poster.avif?t=1768055191\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/extras/2d7a48a64d15f6a3503676f884ef3382.webm?t=1768055191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator Command is a <strong>gladiator management sim</strong> set in the brutal world of <strong>ancient Rome</strong>. As the master of a rising Ludus (Gladiator School), you recruit fighters, train their stats, manage staff, balance finances, equip gear, and prepare your roster for real-time arena combat where your planning decides everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/extras/5a04341f9c6d3f469f2252e531d1a120.poster.avif?t=1768055191\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/extras/5a04341f9c6d3f469f2252e531d1a120.webm?t=1768055191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and develop gladiators with distinct stats, traits, and skill progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch real-time battles driven by the builds you create.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire scouts and staff to improve recruitment and recovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and manage gladiators as your school grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through prestige tiers and take on stronger arenas</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Legacy and Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a roster that evolves over seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter multi-round tournaments for higher rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your school with better staff, upgrades, and long-term strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue a rising legacy where smart decisions outlast individual fights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator Command is built for players who want deep management, meaningful choices, and the long-form satisfaction of growing power through discipline and design.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845450?t=1768055191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845450?t=1768055191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/3fd4e77cd2cca629a013bf98a64a4eb1eb7f5ac2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768055191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/3fd4e77cd2cca629a013bf98a64a4eb1eb7f5ac2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768055191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4233480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/extras/2d7a48a64d15f6a3503676f884ef3382.poster.avif?t=1768055191\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https