 long-term strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue a rising legacy where smart decisions outlast individual fights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator Command is built for players who want deep management, meaningful choices, and the long-form satisfaction of growing power through discipline and design.</p>","developers":["Marius Spikas"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/6d0f9ba666cf4abbb36b862706589ae7f5c8269a/header.jpg?t=1768055191","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Gladiator Command \u00a9 2025 Marius Spikas. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845450/1503315983/92d18fd6f1da3ea0746a1681ceb590805cd672f3/1767567186/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768055190","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845450/1503315983/92d18fd6f1da3ea0746a1681ceb590805cd672f3/1767567186/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768055190","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845450/1503315983/92d18fd6f1da3ea0746a1681ceb590805cd672f3/1767567186/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768055190","id":257246870,"name":"Gladiator Command Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257246870/bfe4a7c85e698d6177a65eba93cfdf19026bf5b6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768055190"}],"name":"Gladiator Command","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Re